  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Chat with AI Tutor\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\nWork with your partner to compare AI Tutor and ELIZA.\r\n\r\n1. Choose one prompt to try in both tools.\r\n\r\n2. Type the prompt into AI Tutor. Your partner will type the same prompt into ELIZA.\r\n\r\n3. Record AI Tutor’s response in your activity guide.\r\n\r\n4. Try one follow-up prompt and record AI Tutor’s response.\r\n\r\nAs you chat, notice how AI Tutor’s responses are similar to or different from ELIZA’s responses.",
