          "botName": "AI Tutor",
          "description": "A modern AI chatbot students use to compare with ELIZA.",
          "intendedUse": "Students ask AI Tutor the same prompts they try with ELIZA, then compare how each chatbot responds.",
          "limitationsAndWarnings": "AI Tutor may still make mistakes or misunderstand prompts. Students should compare responses thoughtfully and not assume every answer is correct.",
          "testingAndEvaluation": "Tested with classroom-friendly prompts about feelings, school questions, confusion, and project help.",
